---
title: "Home"
description: "JISR - جسر, an independent movement building bridges between Moroccans worldwide and Morocco."
---
<section class="hero-home">
  <span class="hero-ghost" aria-hidden="true">جسر</span>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">Launch statement · August 19, 2026</span>
      <h1><span class="line">Building <span class="mark">bridges</span>.</span><span class="line">Sharing ideas. Bringing skills closer together.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">JISR - جسر is an independent, non-political movement whose ambition is to build bridges between Moroccans living abroad and Morocco, placing skills, experience and ideas at the heart of its approach.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/en/join/">Join the movement <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost-light" href="/en/manifesto/">Read the manifesto</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="hero-badges">
      <li>Independent</li>
      <li>Non-political</li>
      <li>An open space</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    {% include "partials/bridge.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our manifesto</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Our four principles</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">The movement is built around four principles that guide everything we do.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillars pillars--arch">
      <div class="pillar-card reveal">
        <span class="num">1</span>
        <h3>Connect</h3>
        <p>Bring Moroccans around the world closer to each other and to stakeholders in Morocco.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card reveal">
        <span class="num">2</span>
        <h3>Contribute</h3>
        <p>Put everyone's skills and experience to work for the country's development.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card reveal">
        <span class="num">3</span>
        <h3>Share</h3>
        <p>Pass on knowledge, ideas and personal journeys across generations and borders.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card reveal">
        <span class="num">4</span>
        <h3>Act</h3>
        <p>Turn intentions into concrete projects, with and for Morocco.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="profiles">
  <div class="container profiles-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Who can join?</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Your journey has a place at JISR</h2>
      <p class="section-sub" style="margin-bottom:26px;">Whatever your country of residence, your field or your generation.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/en/join/">Join the movement <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <ul class="chips reveal">
        <li>Doctors</li>
        <li>Engineers</li>
        <li>Entrepreneurs</li>
        <li>Researchers</li>
        <li>Lawyers</li>
        <li>Students</li>
        <li>And many other talents</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container letter-grid">
    <div class="letter-side reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Statement</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">The launch statement</h2>
      <p class="meta-line">Paris, August 19, 2026</p>
    </div>
    <div class="prose prose--letter reveal">
      <p class="first">The observation is simple: all around the world, doctors, engineers, entrepreneurs, researchers, lawyers, students and many other talented individuals wish to maintain a connection with Morocco and contribute, in their own way, to its development.</p>
      <p>JISR wants to facilitate these connections, highlight these journeys, and build bridges with economic, academic, community and institutional stakeholders in Morocco.</p>
      <p>Non-political and independent of any party or political organization, JISR does not claim to speak on behalf of all Moroccans around the world. Above all, it aims to create an open space for those who wish to share their experience, skills and ideas in service of Morocco.</p>
      <p class="signature">JISR - جسر</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set posts = collections.articles_en %}
{% if posts.length %}
<section style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-row">
      <h2 class="section-title">{{ t.latest }}</h2>
      <a class="link-arrow" href="{{ t.articlesUrl }}">{{ t.allArticles }} <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    {% set maxItems = 3 %}
    {% include "partials/article-list.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-inner reveal">
      <h2>Join the movement</h2>
      <p>Whether you're a doctor, engineer, entrepreneur, researcher, lawyer, student, or passionate about another field, your journey has a place at JISR.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-light" href="/en/join/">Join JISR <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost-light" href="/en/contact/">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
